{"id":"654984","name":"红薯糯米糍","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/654984/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红薯","amount":"1个"},{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"120g"},{"name":"玉米淀粉","amount":"20g"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"10颗"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"蒸熟的红薯。","img":"images/654984/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"红枣切开去核。","img":"images/654984/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"红薯按压成泥。","img":"images/654984/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入糯米粉和玉米淀粉。","img":"images/654984/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入切好红枣粒，加入适量的水。","img":"images/654984/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"和成面团。","img":"images/654984/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搓成小球。","img":"images/654984/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盘底刷油，放入糯米团子，团子表面再刷上一层油防粘。","img":"images/654984/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"水开入锅蒸15分钟即可。","img":"images/654984/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。甜甜的，糯叽叽。","img":"images/654984/step_10.jpeg"}],"tips":"红枣的甜度已足够，所以没有再加糖。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}